The fight was very intense; many of our companions were wounded so that I could reach Yagditha and enter his mind. The effort of the Pristonians on the surface was key. Thanks to them, who channeled their energy to Arteres through the Blessing of Idhas, she fired that precise shot that unsettled Vomori Yagditha.

The continent also went through intense fighting to defend Pillai and the other shelters, protecting the people from the specters' infection. The Magic Masks of the Emerald Spirit helped keep the contamination from spreading.

Please, deliver the Top Secret Documents to Commander Derik in Ricarten.
